{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under His Eyes is a gritty, story-driven strategy game where you play a crime boss. Make game-changing decisions, manage your crew and income, send operatives on missions, seize districts, and eliminate rivals. Will you rise through subtlety, rule with fear, or fall to a small-time gang?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE HARD CHOICES WITH REAL IMPACT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/7613193582e37d96c0707f7b315ce47f.poster.avif?t=1757039928\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/7613193582e37d96c0707f7b315ce47f.webm?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/7613193582e37d96c0707f7b315ce47f.mp4?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shapes your path. Choose wisely to grow your empire or risk losing everything. Take out the competition, make them join your ranks or make them betray their boss... But remember, you're also exposed....</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENGAGE IN THE FIGHT TO TAKE OVER DISTRICTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/bd4c7e6008fa2f2ba65c5d6c55e9d984.poster.avif?t=1757039928\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/bd4c7e6008fa2f2ba65c5d6c55e9d984.webm?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/bd4c7e6008fa2f2ba65c5d6c55e9d984.mp4?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your control by seizing vital parts of the city. Each district offers new resources and strategic advantages. But watch out\u2014rivals won\u2019t give up without a fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND YOUR BASE OF OPERATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/6f9e203af4bdf15fdb1a5763f7862ef7.poster.avif?t=1757039928\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/6f9e203af4bdf15fdb1a5763f7862ef7.webm?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/6f9e203af4bdf15fdb1a5763f7862ef7.mp4?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your power beyond the streets by building your criminal enterprise. Invest in commerce, form alliances, and develop new income streams to strengthen your grip on the city. Every move expands your influence and secures your future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR CREW AND YOUR INCOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/527948ff2a677188564962332bf02ca5.poster.avif?t=1757039928\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/527948ff2a677188564962332bf02ca5.webm?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/527948ff2a677188564962332bf02ca5.mp4?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your crew loyal and your finances strong. Assign jobs carefully to balance risk and reward. A well-run operation is the key to survival. Deploy your team on various jobs to increase influence and income. Missions require strategy and timing to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game-changing conversation with multiple outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage force and money to send operatives on missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over districts to expand your empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight to show who's really the boss</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938380?t=1757039928","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/1cbc8db64ae00c2a0e7138c047ef68d3132be89c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757039928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/4ef907617e8e1cc4ae23b56367c7b680baa69ae0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757039928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/4ef907617e8e1cc4ae23b56367c7b680baa69ae0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757039928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains moderate violence and mature themes, such as gunfight, organized crime."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under His Eyes is a gritty, story-driven strategy game where you play a crime boss. Make game-changing decisions, manage your crew and income, send operatives on missions, seize districts, and eliminate rivals. Will you rise through subtlety, rule with fear, or fall to a small-time gang?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE HARD CHOICES WITH REAL IMPACT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/7613193582e37d96c0707f7b315ce47f.poster.avif?t=1757039928\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/7613193582e37d96c0707f7b315ce47f.webm?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/7613193582e37d96c0707f7b315ce47f.mp4?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shapes your path. Choose wisely to grow your empire or risk losing everything. Take out the competition, make them join your ranks or make them betray their boss... But remember, you're also exposed....</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENGAGE IN THE FIGHT TO TAKE OVER DISTRICTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/bd4c7e6008fa2f2ba65c5d6c55e9d984.poster.avif?t=1757039928\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/bd4c7e6008fa2f2ba65c5d6c55e9d984.webm?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938380/extras/bd4c7e6008fa2f2ba65c5d6c55e9d984.mp4?t=1757039928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your control by seizing vital parts of the city. Each district offers new resources and strategic advantages. But watch out\u2014rivals won\u2019t give up without a fight.</p><h2 class